  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074602/description_670c44a4-aa1a-411f-bbfc-4a5fec532b04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"247\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">&#160; над этим !</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&#128197; &#124;&nbsp; О &#124;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Furniture Beetle - это мод, который сосредоточен на добавлении контента для игры vanilla.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Найдите новый Vanilla+ опыт с мебелью.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GZiVFXv.png\" alt=\"barra2\" width=\"2063\" height=\"51\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&#128;;&#128770;&#128;;&#128770;未來的更新 &#128;;&#128770;&#128;;&#128770;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">make the oven functional</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Custom GUIs</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Color variation between furniture</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">More vanilla furniture&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Feedback and suggestions <span>are welcome 😊</span></span></p>",
